<ul class="content-list">
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">The activity duration depends on your selected package (<span class="highlight">15–70 minutes</span>).</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">Operational Hours: <span class="highlight">8:00 AM – 5:00 PM</span>.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">The exact meeting point will be shared after booking confirmation.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">Participants aged <span class="highlight">16–50 years</span> are eligible and must book their own ticket. Those below 16 or above 50 are not permitted.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">Maximum weight limit: <span class="highlight">90 kg</span> per participant.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">Jeep transfers are provided from the meeting point to the take-off site and from the landing site back to the meeting point.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">The activity may be delayed or postponed due to weather — rescheduling details will be provided in such cases.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text"><span class="warning">Not recommended</span> for pregnant women (over 3 months) or those with major surgeries, broken bones, or chronic back/neck issues.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">Arrive at the venue at least <span class="highlight">30 minutes</span> before your scheduled slot.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">Follow all instructions from your certified pilot/instructor carefully.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">The instructor reserves the right to deny participation to anyone deemed unfit for the activity.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">Consumption of alcohol or heavy meals before or during the activity is <span class="warning">strictly prohibited</span>.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">Images are for representation only; actual experience may vary slightly depending on conditions.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">Carrying sharp objects, lighters, alcohol, knives, or large bags is <span class="warning">strictly prohibited</span>.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">Please avoid littering to help keep the destination clean.</span></li>
<li class="content-item"><span class="item-text">Valid ID proof (Aadhaar, Passport, or Driver's License) is mandatory. <span class="warning">PAN Card is not accepted</span>.</span></li>
</ul></div>
